msgid ""
"The onboard XBee socket can be used to expand functionality with `Plugin "
"accessories <https://www.ardusimple.com/radio-links/>`_ (MR/LR radios, "
"Bluetooth, WiFi, Ethernet, Dataloggers, RS232, Canbus, L-Band)."
